Kode di bawah ini mencari nilai target dalam array terurut menggunakan Binary Search. Susunlah Output/Keluaran dari kodenya.```public class BinarySearch { 
    public static void main(String[] args) { 
        int[] arr = {2, 3, 4, 7, 9, 10, 15, 20, 40}; 
        int target = 10; 
        int l = 0, r = arr.length - 1; 
        while (l <= r) { 
            int m = l + (r - l) / 2; 
            System.out.println(arr[m]); 
            if (arr[m] == target) { 
                System.out.println("Found"); 
                break; 
            } 
            if (arr[m] < target) l = m + 1; 
            else r = m - 1; 
        } 
    } 
}```
